    "t0": "Frame timestamps are taken with time.perf_counter() at the instant OpenCV returns the frame \u2014 NOT true photon arrival. Sensor exposure and driver/USB transport add an unmeasured constant offset, so photon-to-answer latency reported here is a LOWER BOUND.",
